{"unit_id":"sryimnoob123__dsh-global-prompt#card-zh","repo":"sryimnoob123/dsh-global-prompt","commit":"de3c329a28e8e611dcdbfc477a3599f258cea77a","type":"card","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:29-42","index.js:117-154","client.js:43-75"],"text":"dsh-global-prompt 是面向 DSH Web 设置界面的提示词管理插件。它在设置页提供全局、项目和通知选项，并通过服务端 API 编辑 DSH_HOME 下的 AGENTS.md 与各工作区的 AGENTS.md。全局指令可与文件双向同步；对话组装时可加入 Harness 身份或自定义人设，也可控制运行时上下文。插件还提供浏览器端任务结果通知。适合希望通过图形界面维护 DSH 指令和人设的用户。需要 Node.js 20 或更新版本及可写的 DSH 配置和工作区文件。"}
{"unit_id":"sryimnoob123__dsh-global-prompt#card-en","repo":"sryimnoob123/dsh-global-prompt","commit":"de3c329a28e8e611dcdbfc477a3599f258cea77a","type":"card","lang":"en","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:29-42","index.js:117-154","client.js:43-75"],"text":"dsh-global-prompt adds prompt controls to DSH Web settings. It edits global and workspace AGENTS.md files, syncs global settings with disk, and adds a custom persona or Harness identity to conversations. It controls runtime context and offers browser session notifications. Requires Node.js 20+."}
